# LF in the repository, LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This file exists from the first commit deliberately. Two repos in this
# workspace have a red lint baseline made entirely of `Delete ␍` — 9,216 in
# `aeo-howto-web` and most of `aeo-backend`'s 33,818 — because `core.autocrlf`
# is true globally, neither repo pinned line endings, and prettier then rejects
# every line of every file on a Windows checkout. Both cost real time to
# diagnose and neither is fixable without rewriting every file in the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git neither converts them nor tries to diff them.
*.gz  binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
